now:
  task: Active owner-authorized ecosystem cleanup across all seven canonical Rust repositories; concrete fixes, meaningful checks, regular commits and pushes. The full goal remains incomplete.
  preservation: Raw reports, manifests, syntheses, TDD deltas, ledger dispositions, wiki evidence, and immutable operation history remain intact.
  policy: MemoryEndpoints has two distinct authorized uses: direct agent coordination across sites and the separate TinyRustLM.com Connect user long-term-memory plugin.
  redundancy: Keep one canonical source and model location, use Git for history, and keep bounded evidence compact. Record useful experimental lessons before retiring obsolete files.

ecosystem_cleanup:
  progress: docs/ecosystem-cleanup-2026-09-12.md
  lessons: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/ecosystem-experiment-lessons-2026-09-12.md
  checkpoints: Catalog/P2P 4e1ee34; admission/cache/installer 3302239; worker URL and streamed offsets d684db0; bounded companion reader and historical quantization lessons b2ca293; current-only chooser integration fec548b. All pushed. MiniModel.MiRust prepared documentation and canonical publication metadata are pushed through b437611; no publication.
  verification: Acquisition browser checks passed 53 with three desktop-only skips on mobile; 12 further desktop/mobile shell checks and 46 race/cache checks passed. After removing 67 unused constants, 96 affected unit checks passed. Thirty-seven release/server/shell/fixture checks passed with the staged validator in memory. No real-model qualification or public seed is claimed.
  native_seed_integration: Committed/pushed as 6617ca1. Replaced copied repository/rewritten converter/temporary host-source construction with the canonical DirectSeedWireFixtureTool and two synthetic data variants in the existing conversion fixture. Six JS integration/helper checks and 44 affected native checks passed; build had zero warnings/errors. Fixture-helper line coverage 100 percent; C# coverage was not collected at that checkpoint. Owned temporary state removed. No real model or public seed claim.
  native_journal_review: Ten companion test files now use bounded owned canonical scratch. The full suite exposed a partially written history-record race; journal reads and writes now share reentrant in-process and exclusive process locking, with strict record checks unchanged. All 216 native tests passed normally and instrumented. Journal line coverage 85.68 percent, all 33 changed instrumented lines covered; scratch helper 83.95 percent. Compact proof artifacts/ecosystem-cleanup-20260912/native-journal-coverage.json; raw scratch removed.
  remaining: Publication-tool integration, test scratch policies in other native projects, historical experiment and artifact retirement, real-model qualification, initial MiniModel seed hosting, and affected release metadata remain open.
  blocked_deletions: Automatic review rejected Runtime historical docs, LMComposer historical stage files, MiniModel.MiRust's 27-file historical stage and two obsolete TinyRust announcement files. Exact-hash PowerShell cleanups await owner execution. All pending bytes are still reported present; the old announcement test remains incompatible with the retired API.

